#: data/de.linuxundich.Dandelion.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Dandelion lets you write a post once and publish it to several social "
"networks at the same time or at a planned time: Mastodon, Bluesky, LinkedIn, "
"Facebook pages and X."
msgstr ""

#: data/de.linuxundich.Dandelion.metainfo.xml.in:11
